OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire Water given lowest
OL,4,Aenvironmental rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water has been given the
OL,7,Flowest possible environmental rating by
OL,8,Fthe Environment Agency (EA) after a
OL,9,Fsharp rise in pollution incidents.
OL,11,FThe regulator has formally downgraded
OL,12,Fthe company from two stars out of four
OL,13,Fto one, meaning it is now classed as a
OL,14,F"poor performing company" for its
OL,15,Fimpact on the environment.
OL,17,FThe firm, which serves 2.4 million
OL,18,Fhomes in the region, said its
OL,19,Fenvironmental performance was "not
OL,20,Fwhere it needs to be".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
