OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire Water given lowest
OL,4,Aenvironmental rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company has pledged to spend #8.3bn
OL,7,Fover five years on improvements, but
OL,8,Fsaid customers' bills would provide
OL,9,Fmost of the money to achieve that
OL,10,Ffigure.
